      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠠᠩᠬᠢᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
      <uighur>anggilaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>ангилах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>ANGGILA-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. To divide, separate, segregate, discriminate; to. classify, subdivide, put in categories; to hedge off, fence off, partition. (as by walls or fences).</definition>
